# =============================================================================
# HOW TO FILL - QUICK STEPS (See ENV_KEYS_GUIDE.md for detailed links)
# =============================================================================
# 1. DATABASE: docker-compose up -d → DATABASE_URL already works for local
#    For prod: Create at neon.tech → Copy postgres URL → Paste to DATABASE_URL
# 2. JWT: Run `openssl rand -hex 32` → Paste to JWT_SECRET
# 3. RAZORPAY: dashboard.razorpay.com/app/keys → Copy test/live keys → Paste
# 4. SMS: msg91.com → API key + DLT template ID → Paste to SMS_API_KEY + SMS_TEMPLATE_ID
#    Set OTP_ENABLED=false in prod for real SMS
# 5. EMAIL: resend.com/api-keys → Create key → Paste to EMAIL_API_KEY
# 6. STORAGE: AWS S3 or Cloudflare R2 → Create bucket → Get keys → Paste
#    Set STORAGE_PROVIDER=s3 or r2 in prod (not local - Vercel loses files)
# 7. MAPS: console.cloud.google.com → Enable Maps JS + Places → Create key → Paste
# 8. AI: platform.openai.com/api-keys → Create key → Paste to OPENAI_API_KEY (or leave empty)
# 9. PUSH: npx web-push generate-vapid-keys → Paste keys
# 10. REDIS: console.upstash.com/redis → Create → Copy URL + Token → Paste
# 11. APP URL: Set NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL to your Vercel URL https://...
# 12. PROD: Set NODE_ENV=production, NEXT_PUBLIC_SHOW_DEMO_CREDS=false, OTP_ENABLED=false
# =============================================================================
# MINIMAL REAL PROD NEEDS: DATABASE_URL + JWT_SECRET + NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL
